# A Nation on the Brink (WotG 14) finished with a full bag. A GM status 5 and the zone-in plays 22; its finish
# completes the mission but the item 184 is refused (6387) so Unclaimed is set to 1. With room, the _qm5 plays 5 and
# finish option 1 gives item 184 and clears Unclaimed.
lists SauromugueChampaignS/Bulwark_Gate/onTrigger SauromugueChampaignS/onEventFinish/6 BatalliaDownsS/Underpass_Hatch/onTrigger BatalliaDownsS/onZoneIn/1 BatalliaDownsS/onEventUpdate/4 BatalliaDownsS/onEventFinish/3 BatalliaDownsS/onEventFinish/4 BatalliaDownsS/onEventFinish/20 BatalliaDownsS/onEventFinish/21 BatalliaDownsS/onEventFinish/22 BatalliaDownsS/_qm5/onTrigger BatalliaDownsS/onEventFinish/5
char zone=BatalliaDownsS pos=314.083,-1.16,-181.455 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg ANationOnTheBrink current
login
missionstatus Wotg 5
fill-inventory
tick 400
login open                              # 22
finish                                  # completed; the bag full: Unclaimed 1
free-inventory
trigger _qm5                            # 5
finish option=1                         # the flag; Unclaimed 0
